## Important Framing

NOVA.md is read by the agent at the start of every session. Write it **for Claude, not for humans**.
Every sentence should answer: "what does the agent need to know to avoid mistakes and work efficiently?"

- `"Run uv run pytest -x to test"` → useful
- `"The project uses pytest for testing"` → not useful
- `"NEVER edit files in migrations/ — they are auto-generated"` → useful
- `"The codebase follows clean architecture principles"` → not useful

