## Quality Rules

Before writing, verify every item:

- [ ] Every command in the Commands table is copy-pasteable and correct
- [ ] Architecture bullets describe implications, not just facts
- [ ] Conventions tell the agent what TO DO and what NOT TO DO
- [ ] Guardrails use **NEVER** and give a reason
- [ ] Key Files lists only the 5–8 most important files, not every file
- [ ] No section is vague ("follows best practices" → delete it)
- [ ] Empty sections are omitted entirely

**Character limit: NOVA.md must stay under 10,000 characters (~3,000 tokens).**
Trim Key Files first, then Conventions, then Architecture if over the limit.

